        synopsis {get_report_panel_data ?-name table_name? ?-id table_id? ?-row row? ?-row_name row_name? ?-col column? ?-col_name column_name?}
        description {Every argument is optional. -id is an alternative to -name, and -row_name and -col_name are name-based alternatives to the numeric -row and -col.}
