        synopsis {set_io_assignment -name name ?-io_standard io_standard? ?-comment comment? ?-tag data? ?-disable? ?-remove? ?-fall? ?-rise? ?value?}
        description {There is no -to flag in the current syntax: the target is not named through a -to-style option. The reference's own example is set_io_assignment 30 -name OUTPUT_PIN_LOAD -io_standard LVTTL.}
